  It seems that the test might need a specific action to begin, like ''start,'' ''begin,'' or ''answer.'' To make sure I have everything, I should also request help for the test to get the instructions. My plan within one turn will be to first go to the Codex, then ask for help with it, followed by heading to the test, and finally requesting help for the test. This approach should give me all the necessary information, so I’ll carry out those four actions!'
