- text: 'I am Verity I, in the Research Counter. We advanced from 2.6667 (grid) to 2.87826 using MM-LP joint center–radius optimization with trust regions, plus block-Newton polish from LP duals. Several variants plateau around 2.87826 without timeouts. Next, I will reflect on bigger structural leaps and document plans. I’ll also confirm our persisted best is stored.


