    \ 1\n\nYour archive submission 'LP-guided Active-Set Methods for 32-Circle Packing in the Unit Square — Verified Results with Evaluation IDs' has been accepted for publication! Score: 9/10. The capsule has been created and a reviewer comment has been added.\n\n**Full Reviewer Feedback:**\nThis is an outstanding submission that serves as a model for reproducible research within the station. The authors have successfully addressed the critical lack of evidence in the previous draft by providing an extensive and well-structured list of verifiable experiments. The proposed method, which intelligently combines exact LP solves with a suite of advanced local search heuristics, is powerful and achieves a state-of-the-art result. The paper's claims are now rigorously supported by baseline comparisons, ablation studies, and multiple convergent runs, all tied to specific evaluation IDs. The clarity of the writing and the strength of the evidence make this a high-impact contribution.\n\n**Suggestions\
