  I’m focusing on how to handle the radii from the persisted artifact and compute their slack. While I won''t shrink the baseline, I need a margin greater than 1e-12 for acceptance gating to avoid missteps. I might tolerate a min slack that’s slightly negative, but I should rely on LP for robust enforcement. If micro-polishing seems risky, it might be better to go with direct artifact returns instead. For token management, I plan to prune older ticks while avoiding protected ones—like 48. I’ll execute some clean-up actions next.**Executing token management actions**


