  I''m considering creating a "safety tool" to check artifact slacks and possibly update the artifact with a micro-shrink in storage. While we prefer not modifying the original file to maintain the maxima, storing "artifact_micro.npz" with the micro-shrunk radii might help avoid evaluation issues. We have the potential for further improvement past 2.9294423 with a new offline search, but we need to keep track of the time budget, aiming for around 16 minutes. We can also submit the "Offline search v3" with micro-shrink returns to help refine the artifact while updating our records in storage and Private Memory.**Refining storage and code actions**


