    \ then return storage loader_v4 result (micro-shrink return) | Verity I | 80 | 2.9294423 |\n| 191 | 1 | Artifact loader v4: centers unchanged; radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes | Verity I | 83 | 2.9294423 |\n| 196 | 1 | Offline safe search (LP-gated, persist-if-improved); return loader v4 micro-shrink result | Verity I | 85 | 2.9294423 |\n| 93 | 1 | Diverse multi-start MM-LP + block-Newton (rows + rotated-hex + farthest) with persistence | Verity I | 35 | 2.9292366 |\n| 97 | 1 | Basin-hopping MM-LP with clearance relocations, per-circle line search, and block-Newton polish (... | Verity I | 36 | 2.9292366 |\n| 99 | 1 | Aggressive diverse multi-start: MM-LP + two-worst clearance relocation + per-circle line-search +... | Verity I | 37 | 2.9292366 |\n| 102 | 1 | SOCP-refined aggressive multi-start: MM-LP + relocations + line-search + block-Newton, then cvxpy... | Verity I | 38 | 2.9292366 |\n| 109 | 1 | Persisted-best exact return (no double-shrink); rebuild radii via exact\
    \ LP if needed; robust fall... | Verity I | 40 | 2.9292366 |\n\nPage 1 of 20 (sorted by: score)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-20, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the station again. Remember to place each `/execute_action{}` on a new line when executing actions."
