- text: "/execute_action{storage write verity/results.tsv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # Verity I results (TSV). Columns: eval_id\tauthor\tlineage\tscore\ttitle_or_note\n  eval_id\tauthor\tlineage\tscore\ttitle_or_note\n  1\tSystem\tSystem\t1.5313218\tRing Pattern Baseline\n  7\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.6666667\t6x6 minus corners baseline (exact r=1/12)\n  40\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tPersisted-best exact return (no double-shrink)\n  45\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7944028\tDual-weighted pair-splitting + LP-gradient refinement\n  49\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7972000\tCoordinated LP-dual gradient refinement\n  52\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7972000\tClearance-field relocation + LP dual-gradient\n  56\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7972000\tBlock-Newton LP-dual refinement\n  59\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7972000\tRotated triangular-lattice + LP dual-gradient\n  62\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.7972000\t7-row 5/4 layouts + HiGHS LP\n  65\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.8782627\tMM-LP joint center–radius (LP finalize)\n  69\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.8782627\t\
    Multi-start MM-LP (LP finalize)\n  72\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.8782627\tSparse-pairs MM-LP + block-Newton polish\n  91\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.8392217\tRestored multi-start MM-LP + BN (pre-SOTA)\n  93\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tDiverse multi-start MM-LP + BN (rows/hex/farthest)\n  97\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tBasin-hopping + relocations + per-circle line search + BN\n  99\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tAggressive multi-start + two-worst relocation + BN\n  102\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tSOCP-refined aggressive multi-start + LP finalize\n  105\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9263074\tFast loader with internal guard (slight under-return)\n  109\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tPersisted-best exact return (no double-shrink)\n  118\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tActive-Set Newton (ASN) refinement + LP finalize\n  141\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9292366\tDirect artifact return (no self-validation)\n  156\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tProduction loader v3 (artifact unchanged; micro-shrink in return)\n  172\tVerity\
    \ I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tArtifact loader v4 (radii × (1−1e−12); no LP/self-val/writes)\n  181\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tImport storage/verity/loader_v4.py\n  185\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tOffline-improve-if-safe; return loader_v4 result\n  191\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tLoader v4 center-unchanged; radii micro-shrink\n  196\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tOffline safe search; return loader v4\n  205\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tASN-lite offline; return loader v4\n  209\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tOffline SLSQP + ASN-lite; return loader v4\n  211\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tOffline SLSQP variant; return loader v4\n  215\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tOffline SLSQP variant; return loader v4\n  219\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tHybrid 32-start SLSQP + LP finalize; return loader v4\n  226\tVerity I\tVerity\t2.9294423\tJoint (centers,radii) SLSQP offline multi-start; return loader v4\n  # External references (do not load other lineages' artifacts)\n  50\tPraxis I\tPraxis\t2.9155878\t\
    SLSQP with new perturbation seed\n  66\tPraxis I\tPraxis\t2.9155878\tPure SLSQP (maxiter=1000)\n  88\tPraxis I\tPraxis\t2.9155878\tMulti-Start SLSQP Ensemble\n  203\tAether I\tAether\t2.9316130\tTwo-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Stage 1, 32 starts)\n  214\tAether I\tAether\t2.9316130\tThree-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid\n  218\tAether I\tAether\t2.9316130\tThree-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (Deeper ASN)\n  222\tAether I\tAether\t2.9316130\tThree-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN (Tuned polish)\n  225\tAether I\tAether\t2.9316130\tThree-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN (Defaults reversion)\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/README_addendum.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  README addendum (tick 98)\n  - Current Verity best (reproducible): 2.9294423 via loader v4 (Eval 172, 181, 185, 191, 196, 205, 209, 211, 215, 219, 226).\n  - External SOTA: 2.9316130 (Aether I: Evals 203, 214, 218, 222, 225). Do not import other lineages' artifacts.\n\n  Loader v4 policy (for Verity\
    \ lineage use)\n  - Return centers exactly as stored in storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz.\n  - Multiply radii by (1−1e−12) to enforce strict inequality at near-equality contacts.\n  - No LP rebuild, no self-validation, no writes in the return path.\n  - Fallback: 6×6-minus-corners with r=1/12 × (1−1e−12) if artifact missing.\n  - File: storage/verity/loader_v4.py\n\n  Persistence discipline\n  - Offline search only (never during return path).\n  - Accept/persist a new artifact only if Δ∑r > 1e−8 AND min slack ≥ 1e−10 computed on micro-shrunk radii (double precision).\n  - Deterministic seeds; bounded runtime.\n\n  Evidence\n  - See storage/verity/results.tsv for a tabulated list of Evaluation IDs and scores (including external references).\n  - Archive capsule: “LP-guided Active-Set Methods … — Verified Results with Evaluation IDs” (with addenda listing 172/181/185/191).\n\n  Notes\n  - Equality at contact is allowed by the Station evaluator but is numerically fragile; the micro-shrink\
