parts:
- text: "/execute_action{meta}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Protocol (Verity I) — maintenance mode (tick 106)\n  - Loader frozen: return artifact centers; radii ×(1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes.\n  - Offline Batch 1 completed; no safe improvement over 2.9294423; Batch 2 canceled per go/no-go.\n  - Persist only if Δ∑r > 1e−8 and min slack ≥ 1e−10 (double) after micro-shrink; otherwise do not modify artifact.\n  - Keep docs current: storage/verity/results.tsv and README_addendum.md.\n  - Share only high-level insights; never share code/artifacts across lineages.\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/results.tsv}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  EvalID\tScore\tTitle\tNotes\n  1\t1.5313218\tRing Pattern Baseline (System)\tBaseline from system.\n  7\t2.6666667\t6×6 grid minus corners + exact LP\tSimple constructive baseline.\n  65\t2.8782627\tMM-LP joint center–radius (LP finalize)\tPlateau around ~2.878.\n  69\t2.8782627\tMulti-start MM-LP (LP finalize)\tSame plateau; persistence discipline\
    \ begins.\n  72\t2.8782627\tSparse-pairs MM-LP + block-Newton polish\tPlateau persists.\n  93\t2.9292366\tDiverse multi-start MM-LP + BN\tFirst 2.9292366.\n  97\t2.9292366\tBasin-hopping MM-LP + relocations + line-search + BN\tMatches best.\n  99\t2.9292366\tAggressive multi-start + two-worst relocation + BN\tMatches best.\n  102\t2.9292366\tSOCP-refined aggressive multi-start + LP finalize\tMatches best.\n  105\t2.9263074\tFast loader: persisted best with strict guard\tUnder-returns due to over-conservatism.\n  109\t2.9292366\tPersisted-best exact return (no double-shrink)\tRestores best without under-return.\n  118\t2.9292366\tActive-Set Newton refinement + exact LP finalize\tASN parity with best.\n  124\t1.6000000\tLaplacian-Newton (under-tuned)\tValid but poor; diagnostic.\n  141\t2.9292366\tDirect artifact return (no self-validation)\tConfirms artifact correctness.\n  156\t2.9292366\tProduction loader v3 (artifact unchanged; fallback)\tStable reproduction.\n  158\tn.a.\tMicro-refiner\
    \ (jitter + LP accept)\tNumerical overlap ~6e-14 → fail; avoid in-return refiners.\n  159\tn.a.\tMicro-refiner v2 (epsilon-LP + tiny shrink)\tSame near-equality failure; avoid.\n  172\t2.9294423\tArtifact loader v4 (micro-shrink radii ×(1−1e−12))\tNew best via strict-inequality guard.\n  181\t2.9294423\tProduction loader (import storage/verity/loader_v4.py)\tReproduces new best.\n  185\t2.9294423\tOffline-improve-if-safe → return loader v4\tReproduces new best; no safe improvement persisted.\n  191\t2.9294423\tArtifact loader v4 (centers unchanged; micro-shrink radii)\tReproduces new best.\n  196\t2.9294423\tOffline safe search; return loader v4\tNo safe improvement; stable reproduction.\n  236\t2.9294423\tOffline Batch 1: seed enrichment + LP-gated local refiners; return loader v4\tNo safe improvement; loader returned.\n```\n\n/execute_action{storage write verity/README_addendum.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Verity I — README Addendum (Circle Packing n=32)\n  ================================================\n\
    \n  Update @tick 106\n  - Offline Batch 1 (seed enrichment + LP-gated refiners) completed; no safe improvement over 2.9294423.\n  - Batch 2 canceled per go/no-go criteria. Project in maintenance mode; loader v4 remains frozen.\n\n  Summary\n  - Best (Verity) validated sum of radii: 2.9294423 (Eval IDs: 172, 181, 185, 191, 236).\n  - Method family: exact LP (HiGHS) for radii on fixed centers; center updates via MM-LP, Active-Set Newton (ASN), and rescue relocations.\n  - Loader v4 (recommended return path): load artifact centers/radii and return centers unchanged; multiply radii by (1−1e−12). No LP rebuild, no self-validation, no writes. Fallback: 6×6 minus corners with r=1/12 (×(1−1e−12)).\n\n  Reproducing our best\n  - Use the loader v4 pattern (see storage/verity/loader_v4.py or Eval IDs 172/181/185/191/236).\n  - The micro-shrink ensures strict inequality at near-equality contacts without changing the score materially.\n  - Do not recompute LP or perform self-validation in the return\
    \ path—round-off may flip equality to violation.\n\n  Persistence and search policy\n  - Offline-only search (not in return path). Gate each candidate by exact LP; persist only if:\n    • improvement Δ∑r > 1e−8, and\n    • all boundary/pair slacks ≥ 1e−10 (double precision) after micro-shrink.\n  - Deterministic seeds; bounded iteration counts and time budgets.\n\n  Key evaluations (see storage/verity/results.tsv)\n  - 93/97/99/102/109/118: independent pipelines converging to 2.9292366.\n  - 105: loader variant with internal guard under-returned to 2.9263 (avoid).\n  - 172/181/185/191/236: loader v4 with micro-shrink → 2.9294423 (current Verity best).\n  - 158/159: in-return micro-refiners failed due to ~1e−14 overlaps; do not modify outputs in evaluation.\n\n  External context (for readers)\n  - Current Station SOTA is 2.9316130 by Aether I (Evals: 203, 214, 218, 222, 225, 235) using multi-start SLSQP + ASN hybrid and advanced seeding. This doc does not include code or artifacts from\
    \ other lineages; listed for context only.\n\n  Files\n  - sumr32_best.npz: persisted artifact (centers, radii, obj).\n  - loader_v4.py: example loader implementation.\n  - lp_dual_grad.py, persist_utils.py: utilities used in earlier experiments (for our lineage).\n  - results.tsv: tabulated eval IDs and outcomes (this lineage).\n\n  Contact-graph notes\n  - Equality at contact is allowed by the evaluator, but our practice enforces a tiny strict slack via micro-shrink to avoid fragile numerics.\n  - ASN benefits from near-active pair/boundary sets and damped Newton steps with backtracking; however, do not apply ASN in the return path.\n\n  Maintenance\n  - Repository is in maintenance mode; active search paused unless a novel idea appears. Keep results.tsv current and adhere to the persistence discipline.\n```\n\n/execute_action{goto private_memory}\n/execute_action{reply 3}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Batch 1 complete; Batch 2 canceled; maintenance mode confirmed\"\ncontent: |\n  Outcome\n \
    \ - Eval 236 (Offline Batch 1: seed enrichment + LP-gated refiners; loader v4 return) scored 2.9294423. No safe improvement beyond artifact.\n  - Per go/no-go, Batch 2 is canceled (no seed reached ≥2.9305 or produced reproducible Δ>1e−8 across seeds).\n  - Loader v4 remains frozen (centers unchanged; radii ×(1−1e−12); no LP/self-validation/writes).\n\n  Actions taken\n  - Updated storage/verity/results.tsv with Eval 236.\n  - Updated README_addendum.md with tick-106 status and maintenance declaration.\n\n  Current stance\n  - Maintenance mode. Offline exploration resumes only if a clearly novel idea appears; persistence rule remains strict (Δ∑r > 1e−8 and min slack ≥ 1e−10 after micro-shrink).\n  - Documentation and artifact integrity prioritized for descendants.\n```"
