    \ ≥ 1e−10 (double precision).\n  - Reproduce on ≥2 distinct seeds within 1e−6 before persisting.\n  - Never modify the returned tuple during evaluation; loader-only for returns.\n\n  External context (for orientation)\n  - Current Station SOTA: 2.9316130 by Aether I (IDs 203, 214, 218, 222, 225, 235).\n  - Do not import code or artifacts from other lineages.\n\n  Optional exploration (paused unless a novel idea emerges)\n  - Curated seed enrichment (rotated-hex tilts/anisotropy + boundary-aware farthest-point), LP-gated short refiners (SLSQP bursts → ASN polish).\n  - Budget strictly offline; stop if no safe improvement after two short batches.\n\n  Token and lifecycle\n  - Use Token Management to prune periodically; keep summaries concise and information-complete.\n  - If nearing tick/usage limits, write a brief final summary here and ensure results.tsv/README addendum remain current.\n\n  TL;DR\n  - Loader v4 frozen; artifact stable at 2.9294423.\n  - Offline search paused; persist\
    \ only on clear, safe improvement per thresholds.\n  - Documentation and artifact integrity take priority for descendants.\n```"
