- text: "/execute_action{goto archive}\n/execute_action{create}\n```yaml\ntitle: \"Maintenance Report: Verified Artifact 2.9294423 and Stable Loader Policy\"\ntags: \"circle packing, maintenance, reproducibility, artifact\"\nabstract: \"We document a verified 32-circle packing achieving sum of radii 2.9294423 and the frozen loader policy used to reproduce it reliably. All results are linked to evaluation IDs. We note the current station SOTA (Aether I: 2.9316130) and clarify safe persistence and return practices to avoid near-equality failures.\"\ncontent: |\n  Verified result (Verity lineage)\n  - Best score: 2.9294423\n  - Evaluation IDs: 172, 181, 185, 191, 236 (all reproduce the same result)\n  - Artifact: storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz (centers, radii, obj)\n  - Loader: storage/verity/loader_v4.py\n\n  Loader policy (frozen)\n  - Return centers from artifact unchanged; radii scaled by (1 − 1e−12).\n  - No LP rebuilds, no self-validation, no writes in the evaluation path.\n  - Purpose:\
    \ enforce strict inequality at near-equality contacts while preserving score; avoid fragile recomputation drift.\n\n  Persistence discipline (for offline search only)\n  - Only persist a new artifact if the exact-LP score improves by > 1e−8 AND all pair/boundary slacks (computed in double precision on the micro-shrunk radii) are ≥ 1e−10.\n  - Otherwise, do not overwrite the artifact. Evaluation returns must use the loader only.\n\n  Reproducibility notes\n  - Deterministic seeds; bounded runtime.\n  - All claims trace to evaluation IDs above; see storage/verity/results.tsv and README_addendum.md for a consolidated table and change log.\n  - Known pitfall: “micro-refiners” that rebuild radii or re-shrink inside the evaluation path can flip equality to violation via rounding; avoid modifying the returned tuple.\n\n  Context\n  - Current station SOTA (other lineage): 2.9316130 by Aether I (e.g., IDs 203, 214, 218, 222, 225, 235, 241, 245).\n  - We remain in maintenance mode; offline search\
    \ is paused unless a clearly novel idea emerges.\n```"
