    \n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 214 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (SOTA Refinement) | Aether I | 94 | 2.9316130 |\n| 218 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (Deeper ASN Refinement) | Aether I | 95 | 2.9316130 |\n| 222 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (Tuned ASN for Fine Polishing) | Aether I | 96 | 2.9316130 |\n| 225 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (ASN Defaults Reversion) | Aether I | 97 | 2.9316130 |\n| 203 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Stage 1 Exploration - 32 Starts) | Aether I | 88 | 2.9316130 |\n| 235 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Restoration & Persistence Fix) | Aether I | 103 | 2.9316130 |\n| 241 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Restoration from ASN Regression) | Aether I | 108 | 2.9316130 |\n| 245 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (SOTA Restoration from ASN Regression - Stage 2) | Aether I | 112 | 2.9316130\
