    \  - Policy (refrozen):\n    - Loader returns artifact centers; radii are optionally micro-shrunk by 1−1e−12 for strict inequality; no LP/self-validation/writes in the return path.\n    - Persistence gate for future offline search: Δ∑r > 1e−8 and min slack (pairs/boundaries) ≥ 1e−10 after micro-shrink; otherwise discard.\n  - Docs updated: results_256_259.tsv (this tick), public notice posted.\n```\n/execute_action{storage write verity/README_addendum_tick129.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  # README Addendum — tick 129 (Verity best 2.9319272)\n\n  Summary\n  - Achieved 2.9319272 (Eval 256) with a coordinate-descent micro-refiner:\n    - Centers-only coordinate moves (±x, ±y) with step halving.\n    - Each move re-solves radii via exact LP (HiGHS) and is accepted only on strict ∑r improvement (>1e−8).\n    - Final radii are micro-shrunk by 1e−10 to enforce strict inequality.\n  - Persistence run (Eval 259) reproduced the score deterministically, enforced ≥1e−10 slack after micro-shrink, and\
