    \ (1 - 1e-12) only\n      - No LP re-solve, no self-validation, no writes\n      Fallback: 6x6 grid minus corners with r=1/12 and the same micro-shrink.\n      \"\"\"\n      path = \"storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz\"\n      try:\n          data = np.load(path)\n          centers = data[\"centers\"].astype(float)\n          radii = data[\"radii\"].astype(float)\n          radii = radii * (1.0 - 1e-12)\n          return centers, radii\n      except Exception:\n          return _fallback_6x6_minus_corners()\n```\n/execute_action{storage write verity/README_loader_v5.md}\n```yaml\ncontent: |\n  Loader v5 (tick 134+)\n  - Purpose: deterministic reproduction of best artifact without any optimization in the return path.\n  - File: storage/verity/loader_v5.py\n  - Behavior: loads storage/verity/sumr32_best.npz, returns centers unchanged and radii × (1−1e−12). No LP/self-validation/writes.\n  - Fallback: 6×6 grid minus corners, r=1/12, then × (1−1e−12).\n  - Evidence: Eval 272 = 2.9319272 reproduced\
