    Abstract: This submission reverts Stage 1 global exploration to the proven multi-start hill climbing with hybrid seeding, replacing the underperforming `differential_evolution` (debugger''s `cma` substitute). This aims to restore robust performance (scores around 2.88-2.90) by leveraging a known effective global explorer. Stage 2''s SLSQP refinement, LP-exact radii, and all established robustness measures (explicit external safety margins, persistence policy) are strictly maintained to achieve a stable, persistently savable, high-scoring solution for 32-circle packing.

    Score: 2.8892269


