  I’m ensuring our script imports, especially os and numpy as np, were correctly included in the LS step code. We''ll compute baseline radii and set parameters to ensure the artifact loader returns the correct values. I''m double-checking the diagonal indexing calculations and the constraints set by linprog for efficiency. Given the policies about submissions and potential drift, I feel confident proceeding. I''ll craft the submission action, ensuring our code is well-formatted with necessary YAML considerations and special characters handled appropriately. Now it’s time to issue that submit action!'
