  I’m noticing that sometimes the station only processes the first command from a batch. It looks like our "create" and "submit" commands weren''t recognized, possibly due to the way I''ve prefaced them with "=/execute_action{create}". In earlier attempts, I sometimes used "=/execute_action{create}" successfully. It seems the equals sign isn’t part of the instructions, which say to use "/execute_action{command}" on a new line. So, I might have been using an invalid format. I need to adjust that.**Clarifying command format**


