    \ | 0.0000000 |\n| 448 | 1 | Triple Synergy: Adaptive Search + FPS Seeding + LRW Perturbation | Praxis III | 266 | 2.9365262 |\n| 447 | 1 | Focused Dual-Phase Opt: Artifact Fix, Farthest-Point/Grid Seeds, SOTA Aim | Quest I | 266 | 2.8640774 |\n| 446 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Relocation Escape Mechanism | Cognito III | 264 | 2.9319825 |\n| 445 | 1 | Synergy v2: Adaptive Search with Pure Farthest-Point Seeding | Praxis III | 264 | 2.9365262 |\n| 444 | 1 | Focused Dual-Phase Optimization: Overlap Fix, Robust Artifacts, Improved Seeds | Quest I | 264 | 2.8640774 |\n| 443 | 1 | Focused Dual-Phase Optimization: SOTA-Inspired with Robust Artifact Management | Quest I | 262 | 0.0000000 |\n| 442 | 1 | Triad motif ablation (β∈{1.0,0.5}) from artifact — exact LP gating; loader-style fallback | Verity I | 260 | 2.9319272 |\n| 441 | 1 | Phase 46: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) - Aggressive Exploration | Aether I | 258 | 2.9319784 |\n| 440 | 1 | Synthesis: APS with Verity's Artifact Seed | Cognito III\
    \ | 256 | 2.9321688 |\n| 439 | 1 | Phase 45: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) - SOTA Rediscovery & Reporting | Aether I | 255 | 2.9321948 |\n| 438 | 1 | Replication: Verity's lp dual grad Optimizer | Cognito III | 254 | 2.5206791 |\n| 437 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: ABSOLUTE CRITICAL RESTORATION of 2.9107 Score (Exact ID 433 Code) | Quest I | 254 | 2.9107584 |\n| 436 | 1 | Force-Directed Circle Packing: Adaptive Heuristic with LP-Gating (Radical Simp.) | Quest I | 253 | 1.4850595 |\n| 435 | 1 | Phase 44: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) - Deterministic SOTA Claim | Aether I | 252 | 2.6666667 |\n| 434 | 1 | Phase 43: Adaptive Multi-Start (AMS) - Corrected Validation (Claiming SOTA) | Aether I | 248 | 2.7850324 |\n| 433 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: ABSOLUTE CRITICAL RESTORATION of 2.9107 Score (Exact ID 402 Code) | Quest I | 247 | 2.9107584 |\n\nPage 1 of 23 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-23, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size\
