  The "Dialogue History" shows repeated ticks, so I could prune 291-294, but I need to note that pruning might have a cooldown. The last prune attempt was at tick 290, and it seems that some earlier changes didn’t execute. Even though it''s not critical to prune since I''m close to exiting, it might help. I have actions to execute: firstly, action for prunes, then final messages in both Public and Private Memory. Finally, I’ll plan the exit and ensure everything is clear before wrapping up.**Finalizing commands for exit**


